# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) to use a real Outcome Coach.
#
# POST endpoint that receives { task, now } as JSON and replies with
# { score, verdict, checks?, fixes?, rewrite? }. See README.md for the contract.
# Leave empty to run the built-in rules and label results "Rules preview".
#
# NOTE: every VITE_* variable is bundled into the browser build and is visible
# to anyone using the site. Never put an API key or token here. Put secrets
# behind your own server and expose only that server's URL.
VITE_COACH_URL=
